00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:18.431
El Primero.

00:03:18.431 --> 00:03:19.732
Si, si.

00:03:19.732 --> 00:03:21.801
With my broken Spanish, I got the gist.

00:03:21.834 --> 00:03:23.570
Yeah, she's a Democrat.

00:03:23.570 --> 00:03:25.438
Only voted Democrat,

00:03:25.438 --> 00:03:26.472
